{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;War is peace. Freedom is slavery. Ignorance is strength.&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations, Comrade! You have been appointed as an official of the Ministry of Truth. This is a great opportunity to serve the Party. Your task is to rewrite history, control information, and provide the \u2018truth\u2019 dictated by the Party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotions have no place here; thoughts are dangerous. Your path is your choice: obey and remain loyal to the regime, or attempt to resist the system. Remember, Big Brother is watching your every move. Every misstep will be punished, every doubt recorded.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492150/extras/d7956d58b4cc661ce90c9778178dc90a.poster.avif?t=1772984960\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492150/extras/d7956d58b4cc661ce90c9778178dc90a.webm?t=1772984960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492150/extras/d7956d58b4cc661ce90c9778178dc90a.mp4?t=1772984960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Minutes Hate\u00a0</strong><br>Gather for the daily ritual of the <strong>Two Minutes Hate</strong>. Watch the enemies of the Party on giant screens, scream, and surrender to the crowd\u2019s fury. Fear and hatred become loyalty.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492150/extras/2c658928f924e4826e19bd60ec45f8b6.poster.avif?t=1772984960\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492150/extras/2c658928f924e4826e19bd60ec45f8b6.webm?t=1772984960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492150/extras/2c658928f924e4826e19bd60ec45f8b6.mp4?t=1772984960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Truth, Your Choice</strong>\u00a0<br>Rewrite events, alter records, and decide what the public will believe. Every choice shapes <strong>the  \u2018truth\u2019</strong>. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492150/extras/8aa3765b02e962e859a7e38a179406ac.poster.avif?t=1772984960\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492150/extras/8aa3765b02e962e859a7e38a179406ac.webm?t=1772984960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492150/extras/8aa3765b02e962e859a7e38a179406ac.mp4?t=1772984960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep Your Mind Pure</strong><br>Suppress doubts, govern your emotions, and obey the Party. Any weakness, any rebellious thought, threatens both you and the State. <strong>Your mind is</strong> under constant scrutiny.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492150/extras/10d5f3fd57d97ebf33b5ca595b943b52.poster.avif?t=1772984960\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492150/extras/10d5f3fd57d97ebf33b5ca595b943b52.webm?t=1772984960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492150/extras/10d5f3fd57d97ebf33b5ca595b943b52.mp4?t=1772984960\" type=\"video/mp4\